#: templates/core/about.html:13
msgid "Campus Gabaa: Problem, Architecture & Vision"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:15
msgid ""
"Solving information asymmetry and price fragmentation across Haramaya "
"University and surrounding retail markets using open-source, zero-budget "
"cloud engineering."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:25
msgid "The Real-World Campus Problem"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:28
msgid ""
"Haramaya University (HU) is one of Ethiopia's premier higher education "
"institutions, hosting over 30,000 undergraduate and postgraduate students. "
"However, the campus retail geography is intensely fragmented across distinct "
"geographical clusters:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:33
msgid "Main Campus Kiosks"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:34
msgid ""
"Scattered near student dorm blocks (Blocks 1-60) and central administration. "
"Highly convenient, but frequently apply heavy markups and experience rapid "
"stockouts."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:39
msgid "Bate Gate & Town Market"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:40
msgid ""
"The bustling commercial street immediately outside HU campus gates. Offers "
"competitive pricing on stationery, electronics, and groceries, but requires "
"physical travel and price inquiry."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:45
msgid ""
"Prior to Campus Gabaa, students faced three major inefficiencies: (a) severe "
"price variance for identical items (e.g. 100-page notebook varying from 85 "
"to 130 ETB across 3 kiosks), (b) wasted physical walking time searching for "
"items out of stock, and (c) inability to verify whether price quotes heard "
"from peers are still current."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:52
msgid "The Campus Gabaa Solution"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:55
msgid ""
"Campus Gabaa (GabaaHU) is a decentralized campus shopping directory and "
"price-comparison engine designed specifically for low-bandwidth mobile "
"connections and multilingual Ethiopian communities."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:61
msgid "Canonical Product Catalog Decoupled from Shops"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:62
msgid ""
"Instead of duplicate listings that clutter search results, a single product "
"record (e.g., 'Deli 0.5mm Gel Pen') aggregates and ranks all competing shop "
"offers by price."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:68
msgid "Automated Stale-Price Indicators"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:69
msgid ""
"In an inflationary economy, price freshness is essential. Listings track "
"verification timestamps and are visually categorized as Fresh (< 3 days), "
"Expiring (3-7 days), or Stale (> 7 days)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:75
msgid "Crowd-Sourced Accuracy Reporting & Moderation"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:76
msgid ""
"Students report price discrepancies or closed shops directly from product "
"pages, empowering campus moderators to keep the data trustworthy."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:82
msgid "Trilingual Localization (Afaan Oromoo, Amharic, English)"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:83
msgid ""
"Deep internationalization using GNU gettext, offering seamless native-"
"language navigation for the East Hararghe region."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:92
msgid "System Architecture & Zero-Budget Engineering"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:95
msgid ""
"The application is built using a clean, maintainable Django monolithic "
"architecture. To satisfy the strict academic zero-budget constraint, every "
"component was selected for resilience, zero ongoing maintenance cost, and "
"production reliability:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:101
msgid "Layer"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/about.html:102
