#: templates/core/faq.html:4 templates/core/faq.html:10
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች"#: templates/core/faq.html:9
msgid "Help & Guidance"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:11
msgid ""
"Everything you need to know about navigating prices, freshness badges, and "
"shop verification at Haramaya University."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:19
msgid "How does price comparison work on Campus Gabaa?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:24
msgid ""
"Campus Gabaa organizes products into canonical catalog entries. Instead of "
"seeing five different listings for the same '50-Sheet Exercise Book', you "
"click into the product once and see a ranked table comparing every "
"participating campus kiosk and Bate shop from cheapest to most expensive, "
"along with stock availability and exact location."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:33
msgid "What do the Freshness Badges (Fresh, Expiring, Stale) mean?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:38
msgid ""
"To protect students from outdated prices in an inflationary market, every "
"listing displays its verification age:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:40
msgid "FRESH (Green):"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:40
msgid "Confirmed by the shopkeeper within the last 3 days. High confidence."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:41
msgid "EXPIRING (Yellow):"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:41
msgid ""
"Last verified 3 to 7 days ago. Price is likely accurate but could have "
"shifted."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:42
msgid "STALE (Red):"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:42
msgid ""
"Unconfirmed for more than 7 days. We urge students to verify by phone or "
"report discrepancies."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:52
msgid "What should I do if a kiosk charges more than the listed price?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:57
msgid ""
"On any product comparison page, click the 'Report' button next to the shop. "
"You can specify whether the price was higher, the item was out of stock, or "
"the kiosk was closed. You can optionally include what you paid and attach a "
"receipt photo. Our moderation team reviews these reports promptly."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:66
msgid "How do I register a kiosk or shop as a vendor?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:71
msgid ""
"Create an account and select 'Shop Owner / Vendor' as your account type. "
"After registration, you will be prompted to enter your shop's name, campus "
"zone (e.g. Main Campus Kiosk, Bate Gate, Bate Market), specific landmark, "
"opening hours, and phone number. Once submitted, you can immediately start "
"adding items to your inventory."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:80
msgid "How do shop owners keep their prices fresh?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:85
msgid ""
"Through the Vendor Dashboard, shop owners have access to a single-click "
"'Confirm Price Today' button for every item in their inventory. Clicking "
"this refreshes the timestamp to today, logs the verification to the public "
"audit trail, and turns the badge back to vibrant green FRESH without having "
"to re-type the price."
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:94
msgid "Which languages are supported?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/core/faq.html:99
msgid ""
"Campus Gabaa natively supports English, Afaan Oromoo (the primary regional "
"language of Oromia and Haramaya), and Amharic (አማርኛ). You can switch your "
"preferred language at any time using the dropdown selector in the top "
"navigation bar."
msgstr ""

